flowchart TD
    Input["User request"] --> Snapshot["Read exposed entities, states and available actions"]
    Snapshot --> Service{"Decider: service / route"}

    Service -->|unsure| Unsure["Unsure reply"]
    Service -->|general| Enabled{"General model enabled?"}
    Enabled -->|No| Unsure
    Enabled -->|Yes| General["General model + optional HTTP MCP tools"]
    General --> Reply["Assistant reply"]

    Service -->|query_state| QueryArea{"Decider: area"}
    QueryArea -->|Specific room| Room["Filter entities by room"]
    QueryArea -->|"all_areas: no room specified or whole home"| Domains["Decider: domain keep/drop"]
    Room --> QueryTargets["Decider: entity keep/drop"]
    Domains --> QueryTargets
    QueryTargets --> States["Read selected states from snapshot"]
    States --> Answer["Smart-home answer model"]
    Answer --> Reply

    Service -->|HA action| Todo{"todo.add_item?"}
    Todo -->|"Yes: skip area"| Filter
    Todo -->|No| ActionArea["Decider: area — room or no_area"]
    ActionArea --> Filter["Filter by action domain and selected room"]

    Filter --> Shortcut{"Concrete room and multi-target action?"}
    Shortcut -->|Yes| Scope{"Decider: target scope"}
    Scope -->|area| AreaTargets["Use all filtered entities"]
    Scope -->|entities| ActionTargets["Decider: entity keep/drop"]
    Shortcut -->|No| Multiple{"Multi-target action?"}
    Multiple -->|Yes| ActionTargets
    Multiple -->|No| Single["Decider: single entity"]

    AreaTargets --> Parameter{"Required parameter?"}
    ActionTargets --> Parameter
    Single --> Parameter

    Parameter -->|None| Execute["Recheck exposure and execute HA action"]
    Parameter -->|Numeric| Numeric["Decider: absolute/relative mode + value"]
    Numeric --> Validate["Validate baseline, range and rounding"]
    Validate --> Execute
    Parameter -->|Free text| Text["Decider: word keep/drop"]
    Text --> Execute
    Execute --> Answer
